---
mdv: "1.0"
title: Inline directives
---

# Inline directives

Inline directives run inside a sentence and leave the rest of the line as
ordinary Markdown. Revenue rose :mdv-delta[+12.4%]{tone=up} on the quarter,
tracking :mdv-spark[120,148,131,167]{type=line} against a target of
:mdv-metric[160]{label="Target" unit="k"}, which the **bold** text around them
is unaffected by.

An escaped \:mdv-spark is a literal colon, and `:mdv-spark[1,2]` inside code is
code. A name without the prefix — :spark[1,2] — belongs to some other
vocabulary and is left alone.
